Subject: [PATCH 819/822] perf(dsv41): tune vocab head grid width and packed
 BF16 LM head path

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
with candidate-61 series applied through 0818.

Rationale: Sets grid_x=40 and tuned decode schedule for the packed BF16 LM
head and logits path on GB10 SMs.

Quality implications: None; vocab kernel numerical equivalence verified by unit tests.

Tests: pytest -q -p deepseek_models tests/kernels/quantization/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_vocab.py

Upstream status: local candidate-61 patch
